    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n565" root="ارز" body-key="A">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرَزَةٌ</span></b>  The <i>tree called</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْزَنٌ</span> [which is <i>a hard kind,
from which staves are made</i>]: (AA, S, K:)
some say that it is ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آرِزَةٌ</span></b> , of the measure <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَاعِلَةٌ</span>;
but A 'Obeyd disapproves of this. (TA.) See
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أرْزٌ</span>.

